# Celix Bazel module repository marker.
#
# This file is the Starlark repository marker for this Bazel module. Unlike the
# empty REPO.bazel in upstream Apache Celix release tarballs, this marker
# records the repository's role: it is the Apache Celix Bazel module, a Bazel
# wrapper around a snapshot of the Celix framework source tree, separate from
# Celix's own CMake build. bzlmod defines this repository through MODULE.bazel.